<title>USA: Pennsylvania Enterprises sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Pennsylvania Enterprises sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>WILKES-BARRE, Pa. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennsylvania Enteprrises Inc said Wednesday its board declared a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said that certificates representing the additional shares will be sent on or about April 2 to shareholders of record on March 20.</p>
<p>In conjunction with the stock split, its authorized common shares will be increased from 15.0 million to 30.0 million and the stated value a share will be reduced to $5.00 a share from $10 a share, the company said.</p>
</text>
